🇬🇧 English

1. Overview
This Privacy Policy explains how the Discord bot collects and processes data.

2. Collected Data & Purpose
The bot only collects and stores Discord IDs:
* User IDs: Managed for permissions and moderation access control.
* Channel IDs:Configured for moderation channels and logs.
* Guild (Server) IDs:Used to store server-specific configurations.

No message contents, personal information, or private messages are recorded or stored.

3. Data Deletion & Contact
Data is stored as long as the bot remains on the server or until a removal request is filed.

Requesting Data Removal:
You have the right to request the deletion of your stored data at any time. Please send a Direct Message (DM) on Discord to **`@sypex08`**.